Z||000002||ponya||12-31-2000||11:52 PM||||Here are the part numbers I came up with from the P22 catalog<P>Rear fascia has two numbers. One is with option Y82 and one is without it. I guess one of them is the Indy. I just don't know what the Y82 option is. Here are the numbers<P>With Y82 - 10042563<BR>Ex   Y82 - 10032433<P>Right headlight motor - 22039673<BR>Left headlight  motor - 22039672<P>Headlight relay - 10031018<P>Hope that helps!<P>Bob||||reg||3
Z||000003||mrfiero||12-31-2000||11:57 PM||||The Y82 RPO code designates the Indy package. The front fascia is the same on the '84 Indy, '85 GT & '86-'87 SE.||||reg||1
